      content:
        "id: \"hard_problems:voize-senior-product-designer\"\ntitle: Senior Product Designer\ncompany: voize\nurl: \"https://www.hardproblems.com/jobs/role/voize-senior-product-designer\"\napply_url: \"https://www.voize.ai/de/karriere?ashby_jid=a8e73353-60bf-4aba-953e-1f209d5e969e&utm_source=KOGzoOp71J\"\nlocation: \"Berlin, Germany\"\ncountry: DE\nremote: true\nemployment_type: \"full_time\"\npublished_at: \"2026-09-30T00:00:00+00:00\"\ndescription: \"voize is a German health-tech company building an AI companion for nurses and frontline care workers. Founded after co-founders Marcel and Fabio witnessed firsthand how much time caregivers lose to administrative tasks, voize has grown to serve over 180,000 nurses across inpatient care, hospitals, outpatient care, and supported living settings. The company's mission is straightforward: give nurses their time back so they can focus on people rather than paperwork. voize's product suite includes AI-powered documentation, intelligent care planning, shift handover tools, and workflow automation, all designed to reduce the documentation burden that pulls healthcare workers away from patients.\\n\\nThe role\\n\\nvoize is hiring a Senior Product Designer to help shape the experience of a product used daily by tens of thousands of nurses. The role sits within a collaborative, cross-functional product organisation where designers are expected to challenge product managers and contribute ideas that influence direction. You would be working on a product that operates at the intersection of AI, voice technology, and frontline healthcare workflows.\\n\\nWhat they are looking for\\n\\nvoize is looking for a senior-level designer with the experience and confidence to own design outcomes end to end. You would be expected to bring strong craft skills alongside the ability to think strategically about user needs and product direction. The company values people who can turn complexity into clarity, act with urgency, and take genuine ownership of results. Comfort working in a fast-moving, iterative environment is important, as is a genuine interest in the mission of improving conditions for care workers.\\n\\nWorking arrangements\\n\\nvoize offers flexible and remote-friendly working arrangements. You can work from the company office or from home, and the company also allows you to use some remote working days to work from another EU country. The emphasis is on results rather than location or fixed hours, and you are trusted to manage your own schedule.\\n\\nPay and benefits\\n\\nvoize provides 30 vacation days per year plus your birthday as an additional day off. The company covers an Urban Sports Club membership, giving you access to gyms, yoga, swimming, and other fitness activities. You would also join a collaborative team environment with cross-functional working practices and regular opportunities to connect, celebrate, and recharge together as a team.\"\nsalary_min: null\nsalary_max: null\nsalary_currency: null\nsalary_period: null\nprovider: hard_problems\ntype: job_result\nparent_app_skill_type: app_skill_use\nembed_ref: senior-product-designer-Wid\napp_id: jobs\nskill_id: search\nwork_arrangement: \"Remote\"\nsector: \"Healthcare\"\nrole: \"Product design\"\nseniority: \"Senior\"\norganization_type: \"For-profit\"\nvalid_through: \"2026-11-14T00:00:00.000Z\"\ndetail_status: \"complete\"\nimpact: \"voize's AI documentation tool is clearly net-positive, directly reducing nurse burnout and administrative burdens to improve patient care quality.\"",
